      "title": "Locomotion Decoupling",
      "items": [
        "Root Height Anchor: Decouples camera from animated head bone to eliminate running stride bounce",
        "Continuous Damping Slider: Tune from 1.0 (rock-solid horizon) to 0.0 (vanilla bounce)",
        "Preserves Sitting & Bed Overrides: Natural animations maintained when sleeping or resting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Dungeon Anti-Crush & Ergonomics",
      "items": [
        "Min Distance Clamp: Prevents CollideRay2 from crushing camera to point-blank (<1m) in crypts",
        "Adaptive Shoulder Lift: Softly raises camera by +0.35m in tight spaces for clear sightlines",
        "Dynamic FOV Expansion: Automatically expands FOV by +10\u00b0 in narrow corridors to suppress vertigo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Live Tuning & In-Game CLI",
      "items": [
        "Live Hotkey: Press F7 to toggle stabilization on/off instantly during gameplay",
        "In-Game Console: 'unswayed status', 'unswayed height', 'unswayed damping', 'unswayed shake'",
